   "translation": "Hi Uma, I'm Bahn's digital assistant calling about order CD-420442, the Bentley Continental GT. Our driver Kasper won't set off until the seller has lifted the payment hold, so could you tell Bahn as soon as Johan Ekwall has lifted it?",
   "at": "2026-10-21T09:25:34.462Z"
  },
  {
